openmediavault-ai-orchestrator (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release for OpenMediaVault 6 / 7.
  * Support for Google AI Pro (Gemini 3.7 Flash & Pro), Claude Pro (Claude 3.7 Sonnet), and GitHub Copilot Pro (GPT-4o, o1, o3-mini, DeepSeek-R1).
  * WebGUI integration with token inputs, shared folder selector, and container status.

